      "notes": [
        "process in place to not dispatch if the store humidity is high. Atleast from one connect. we wont get money back. FEXA is fine. we can get that money back",
        "Harness design - UL wire spec 10-32. or what. Also what colors do we need and the gage?",
        "Sensor probe number. and the sensor part number. This is all on page 2",
        "Page 3 0 - UL wire types for 12 and 18 gage wires. Want the exact part number you want mega fit and mini fit size. Any insulation needed on the ground terminal.",
        "15amp cord. what UL requirements? For NEMA 5-15. They will send specs. for us to pick.",
        "Fan - Taiko connectors instead of current connectors.",
        "Failure mode of RH cases. ",
        "coating on coil is $20",
        "3/8 to 5/16 coil size. will loose 2% capactiy. same design on both LT and MT. Cost reduction becasuse amount of copper is reduced. Increased the airflow a little bit. Julia will need to find that out. ",
        "7mm also tested. We can increase the capacity. increase the number of circuits. LT and MT same coil.",
        "Also did calculation on aluminum coil - no baseline. ",
        "Conduit can be implemented already - ",
        "First vaccume is not working because of the AC conditions. humidity is so high that the vaccume is struggling to get down to 50 microns. The entire room will be conditioned by the end of next week",
        "Controller - 3 deg F is on . Time is 1hr + 2hr for CTA + 1hr for triage , Dispatch. ",
        "Alarm off criteria is +1F deg. ",
        "Doug: door open ",
        "Door issues vs when they got installed. ",
        "FEXA paredo",
        "Tecumseh will ship lab units on 8/5",
        "Send to Rafeal:",
        "Send the routed gasket quote to Rafael.",
        "Cases need to be joinable. ",
        "Kits : Need everything thats on 1.0 including COD's. ",
        "NOM should be on all the 2.0 cases. get that testing done. ",
        "Set up a meeting with MFG to discuss the end of line testing process",
        "mEETING on 8/7",
        "Short term \u2013 185 quick win. +8 extra savings than expected. 60 in progress ",
        "Med term \u2013 49 for sure. 20 is still in progress. ",
        "Long term  - 50 for sure 55 is evap strategy. Needs tooling investment. ",
        "November is the aluminum. ",
        "-          Didn\u2019t place the orders yet. But will need 13 samples for aluminum ",
        "-          Ordering additional ",
        "May tariff -  $1586 ",
        "Short term price - $ 1503 ",
        "We will get condenser fans - 3 on august 26. need reliability data",
        "evaporator fans - 10. august 26, need reliability data. ",
        "4 units - 2 LT and 2 MT. september 29. ",
        " - Aluminum evap",
        "- seiweri evap fans",
        " - weiguang condenser fan",
        "2 MT units - october 21",
        " - all modifications so far. ",
        "- cap tube changes. ",
        "- uncoated condenser. ",
        "Phase out timeline - still working on that. "
      ],
      "notepad_html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Segoe UI'; font-size:9.9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">process in place to not dispatch if the store humidity is high. Atleast from one connect. we wont get money back. FEXA is fine. we can get that money back</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">Harness design - UL wire spec 10-32. or what. Also what colors do we need and the gage?</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">Sensor probe number. and the sensor part number. This is all on page 2</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">Page 3 0 - UL wire types for 12 and 18 gage wires. Want the exact part number you want mega fit and mini fit size. Any insulation needed on the ground terminal.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">15amp cord. what UL requirements? For NEMA 5-15. They will send specs. for us to pick.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:10.8pt;\">Fan - Taiko connectors instead of current connectors.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Failure mode of RH cases. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">coating on coil is $20</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">3/8 to 5/16 coil size. will loose 2% capactiy. same design on both LT and MT. Cost reduction becasuse amount of copper is reduced. Increased the airflow a little bit. Julia will need to find that out. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">7mm also tested. We can increase the capacity. increase the number of circuits. LT and MT same coil.</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Also did calculation on aluminum coil - no baseline. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Conduit can be implemented already - </p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">First vaccume is not working because of the AC conditions. humidity is so high that the vaccume is struggling to get down to 50 microns. The entire room will be conditioned by the end of next week</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Controller - 3 deg F is on . Time is 1hr + 2hr for CTA + 1hr for triage , Dispatch. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Alarm off criteria is +1F deg. </p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Doug: door open </p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Door issues vs when they got installed. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">FEXA paredo</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Tecumseh will ship lab units on 8/5</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Send to Rafeal:</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Send the routed gasket quote to Rafael.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Cases need to be joinable. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Kits : Need everything thats on 1.0 including COD's. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">NOM should be on all the 2.0 cases. get that testing done. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Set up a meeting with MFG to discuss the end of line testing process</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">mEETING on 8/7</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Short term \u2013 185 quick win. +8 extra savings than expected. 60 in progress </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Med term \u2013 49 for sure. 20 is still in progress. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Long term\u00a0 - 50 for sure 55 is evap strategy. Needs tooling investment. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">November is the aluminum. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">-</span><span style=\" font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; background-color:#fff59d;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Didn\u2019t place the orders yet. But will need 13 samples for aluminum </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">-</span><span style=\" font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; background-color:#fff59d;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </span><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Ordering additional </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">May tariff - \u00a0$1586 </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" background-color:#fff59d;\">Short term price - $ 1503 </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">We will get condenser fans - 3 on august 26. need reliability data</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">evaporator fans - 10. august 26, need reliability data. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">4 units - 2 LT and 2 MT. september 29. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"> - Aluminum evap</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- seiweri evap fans</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"> - weiguang condenser fan</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">2 MT units - october 21</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"> - all modifications so far. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- cap tube changes. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- uncoated condenser. </p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Phase out timeline - still working on that. </p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p></body></html>",
      "is_vave": true
    }
  ]
